        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    equity_value = 150_000_000\n    debt_value = 100_000_000\n    preferred_value = 50_000_000\n    equity_cost = 0.12\n    debt_cost = 0.05\n    preferred_cost = 0.08\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_value = equity_value + debt_value + preferred_value\n    wacc = (\n        (equity_value / total_value) * equity_cost\n        + (debt_value / total_value) * debt_cost\n        + (preferred_value / total_value) * preferred_cost\n    )\n    answer = f\"{wacc * 100:.2f}%\"\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
